---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title={`Terms of use | ${site.name}`} path="/terms/">
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <h2>Scope</h2>
    <p>Work is governed by the written proposal or quote agreed with you.</p>
    <h2>Payment</h2>
    <p>Payment is made in milestones, as set out in your written quote. If a project is paused or cancelled, you pay for the work completed up to that point.</p>
    <h2>Ownership</h2>
    <p>We hand over all files and logins at launch, as set out in your written quote.</p>
    <h2>Revisions and liability</h2>
    <p>The number of revision rounds is set out in your written quote. Our liability for any project is limited to the amount you have paid for that project.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Uganda.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Contact us using the details on our homepage.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
